{
  "lineCounts": {
    "???": 26,
    "Clymene": 84,
    "Orupeusu": 2,
    "Paimon": 9,
    "Player": 14
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7224401",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722440101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722440101": {
            "id": "722440101",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Hmm? How strange. I have not seen someone in your garb for a many long years...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440102"
            ]
          },
          "722440102": {
            "id": "722440102",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "From your mannerisms, you are not from Byakuyakoku either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440103"
            ]
          },
          "722440103": {
            "id": "722440103",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Are you some guest from afar who fell into this place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440104"
            ]
          },
          "722440104": {
            "id": "722440104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That's more or less correct...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440105"
            ]
          },
          "722440105": {
            "id": "722440105",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "To think that there were ways to access Byakuyakoku from the outside world... Shocking news indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440106"
            ]
          },
          "722440106": {
            "id": "722440106",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "I was born here, and I have never seen anyone from the outside world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440107"
            ]
          },
          "722440107": {
            "id": "722440107",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Someone once told me that he wanted to catch a glimpse of the world outside. I took his words for a jest...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440108"
            ]
          },
          "722440108": {
            "id": "722440108",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "*sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440109"
            ]
          },
          "722440109": {
            "id": "722440109",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Traveler. In truth, I have a humble request for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440110"
            ]
          },
          "722440110": {
            "id": "722440110",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "There are seven royal tombs scattered throughout Byakuyakoku, in which the remains of our \"Sunchi{RUBY#[S]Phaethons}ldren\" have been interred.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440111"
            ]
          },
          "722440111": {
            "id": "722440111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Sunchildren...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440112"
            ]
          },
          "722440112": {
            "id": "722440112",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Indeed. Here, we worship the Dainichi Mikoshi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440113"
            ]
          },
          "722440113": {
            "id": "722440113",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "After a certain number of years, an infant will be chosen as the Sunchild, gaining control over the nation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440114"
            ]
          },
          "722440114": {
            "id": "722440114",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "We had... a total of seven Sunchildren.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440115"
            ]
          },
          "722440115": {
            "id": "722440115",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "O rare Traveler from another land, please, kindly pay respects at their tombs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440116"
            ]
          },
          "722440116": {
            "id": "722440116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, why would you need us outsiders to do that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440117"
            ]
          },
          "722440117": {
            "id": "722440117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Isn't it usually up to their family and friends to pay respects to them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440118"
            ]
          },
          "722440118": {
            "id": "722440118",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Indeed, that would normally be the case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440119"
            ]
          },
          "722440119": {
            "id": "722440119",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Unfortunately, I fear that no one in this nation would want to do so.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440120"
            ]
          },
          "722440120": {
            "id": "722440120",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "In fact, it is likely that these royal tombs have not been visited in a long time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440121"
            ]
          },
          "722440121": {
            "id": "722440121",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But why's that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440122"
            ]
          },
          "722440122": {
            "id": "722440122",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do the people of this nation dislike the Sunchildren?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440123"
            ]
          },
          "722440123": {
            "id": "722440123",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "\"Dislike\" is perhaps too kind a word. \"Detest\" might be more fitting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440124"
            ]
          },
          "722440124": {
            "id": "722440124",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "As I said earlier, the Sunchildren were born into their role.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440125"
            ]
          },
          "722440125": {
            "id": "722440125",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "But how could mere children rule a nation? The ones who truly controlled everything were powerful people behind the scenes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440126"
            ]
          },
          "722440126": {
            "id": "722440126",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "The Sunchildren were mere puppets, their every move manipulated by these people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440127"
            ]
          },
          "722440127": {
            "id": "722440127",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "And yet there was no end to the greed of those powerful people. They grew fat off the toil of the people, compelling the Sunchildren to perform heinous deeds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440128"
            ]
          },
          "722440128": {
            "id": "722440128",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "And so, the peoples' ire rose, and many of those sins were laid at the feet of the Sunchildren.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440129"
            ]
          },
          "722440129": {
            "id": "722440129",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's awful...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440130"
            ]
          },
          "722440130": {
            "id": "722440130",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Sunchildren were innocent!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440131"
            ]
          },
          "722440131": {
            "id": "722440131",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Innocent? Oh no, they were not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440132"
            ]
          },
          "722440132": {
            "id": "722440132",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "As far as the people of Byakuyakoku were concerned, their ignorance was the greatest sin of all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440133"
            ]
          },
          "722440133": {
            "id": "722440133",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "A sin, even committed in ignorance, can hurt others. Can a person who commits such transgressions truly be called innocent?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440134"
            ]
          },
          "722440134": {
            "id": "722440134",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "It would be difficult, no? The damage is already done, and it cannot be undone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440137"
            ]
          },
          "722440137": {
            "id": "722440137",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Well, you can consider this... my personal sentimentality speaking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440138"
            ]
          },
          "722440138": {
            "id": "722440138",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "My name is Clymene. I was a female official in charge of taking care of the Sunchildren's daily lives within the Dainichi Mikoshi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440139"
            ]
          },
          "722440139": {
            "id": "722440139",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Though I knew that they did wrong, and though I was aware that they were being manipulated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440140"
            ]
          },
          "722440140": {
            "id": "722440140",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "They were still children that I watched grow up. I pitied them, and I grieved for them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440141"
            ]
          },
          "722440141": {
            "id": "722440141",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "In the end, I could not hate them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440142"
            ]
          },
          "722440142": {
            "id": "722440142",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Though my work involved being around them every day, I was under heavy surveillance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440143"
            ]
          },
          "722440143": {
            "id": "722440143",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "I was not permitted to say a single word when I was around those children.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440144"
            ]
          },
          "722440144": {
            "id": "722440144",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "But when no one was around, when they were helpless and afraid, they would say so, so many things to me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440145"
            ]
          },
          "722440145": {
            "id": "722440145",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "...And I could not offer them a single word in reply.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440146"
            ]
          },
          "722440146": {
            "id": "722440146",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "If I had possessed but a little self-sacrificial courage to say something, anything to them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440147"
            ]
          },
          "722440147": {
            "id": "722440147",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Perhaps everything might have gone differently...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440148"
            ]
          },
          "722440148": {
            "id": "722440148",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "So please, I beg you. I cannot face them as I am, so this is the only way I can honor them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440149"
            ]
          },
          "722440149": {
            "id": "722440149",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Please, good Traveler, lend me your aid just this once.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440150"
            ]
          },
          "722440150": {
            "id": "722440150",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "A single Sango Pearl is all I ask, to be laid before their tombs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440153"
            ]
          },
          "722440153": {
            "id": "722440153",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "This way, you'll be able to light the Soul Lamps at the stone shrine here and open the way to the Soul Guide's Locus and bring their spirits peace...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440151"
            ]
          },
          "722440151": {
            "id": "722440151",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Alright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440152"
            ]
          },
          "722440152": {
            "id": "722440152",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Thank you. This task is in your hands, then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224402",
      "subQuestName": "Offer a Sango Pearl to the seven royal tombs",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722440201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722440201": {
            "id": "722440201",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "There were seven Sunchildren in all. Traveler, please take my place and pay respects before their tombs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224403",
      "subQuestName": "Offer a Sango Pearl to the seven royal tombs",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722440301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722440301": {
            "id": "722440301",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Ah, the seven Soul Lamps are lit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440302"
            ]
          },
          "722440302": {
            "id": "722440302",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "It seems that you have completed your task. I will always remember how you have aided me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440303"
            ]
          },
          "722440303": {
            "id": "722440303",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Now come, allow me to open it for you... The path to the Soul Guide's Locus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440304"
            ]
          },
          "722440304": {
            "id": "722440304",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Traveler from a foreign land, I know that I have caused you much trouble... But please, bear witness as they are laid to rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440305"
            ]
          },
          "722440305": {
            "id": "722440305",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Follow this path. I will meet you on its far side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224404",
      "subQuestName": "Offer a Sango Pearl to the seven royal tombs",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722440401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722440401": {
            "id": "722440401",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Ah, Traveler, you have arrived.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440402"
            ]
          },
          "722440402": {
            "id": "722440402",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "This is the Soul Guide's Locus, and this is where my final thoughts remain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440403"
            ]
          },
          "722440403": {
            "id": "722440403",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "When the Sunchildren reached a certain age, they would follow a ceremony and enter the Dainichi Mikoshi on their birth date.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440406"
            ]
          },
          "722440406": {
            "id": "722440406",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Yes, and that process was known as the Rite of Solar Return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440407"
            ]
          },
          "722440407": {
            "id": "722440407",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "The Sunchildren were birthed from the Dainichi Mikoshi, and they would again return to the seat of the sun before the mortal world could taint them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440408"
            ]
          },
          "722440408": {
            "id": "722440408",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "...The temperature of the Dainichi Mikoshi was such that its light could warm all of Byakuyakoku.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440409"
            ]
          },
          "722440409": {
            "id": "722440409",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Of the Sunchildren, naught but shreds of the souls that once were returned at last to the Locus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440410"
            ]
          },
          "722440410": {
            "id": "722440410",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "But I still believe that, perhaps...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440411"
            ]
          },
          "722440411": {
            "id": "722440411",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Perhaps...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440412"
            ]
          },
          "722440412": {
            "id": "722440412",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "If I was the one who opened the Locus, I might be able to use my memories to supplement what remains of their souls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440426"
            ]
          },
          "722440426": {
            "id": "722440426",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Allow me to try.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440427"
            ]
          },
          "722440427": {
            "id": "722440427",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Piramumon... Orupeusu... I am here. Will you not return?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440428"
            ]
          },
          "722440428": {
            "id": "722440428",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440429"
            ]
          },
          "722440429": {
            "id": "722440429",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How did it go?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440430"
            ]
          },
          "722440430": {
            "id": "722440430",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "*sigh* Of the seven Sunchildren, Piramumon and Orupeusu were raised by mine own hand. If even they will not return...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440413"
            ]
          },
          "722440413": {
            "id": "722440413",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "It seems that my memories alone are insufficient...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440414"
            ]
          },
          "722440414": {
            "id": "722440414",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "If only there was something I could use as a medium... If I had the Divine Bridle, perhaps, the badge of the Sunchild's office, it might just work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440415"
            ]
          },
          "722440415": {
            "id": "722440415",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "But alas! It was lost to us long ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440416"
            ]
          },
          "722440416": {
            "id": "722440416",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "*sigh* This nation, Byakuyakoku, still hates those children.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440417"
            ]
          },
          "722440417": {
            "id": "722440417",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Perhaps my desire to free their souls is but a forlorn hope.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440418"
            ]
          },
          "722440418": {
            "id": "722440418",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "...But still, Traveler, if you would consider this my final request — could you help to find the Divine Bridle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440419"
            ]
          },
          "722440419": {
            "id": "722440419",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "I know that the chances of finding it are quite slim, and indeed, it is rude of me to ask yet more of you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440420"
            ]
          },
          "722440420": {
            "id": "722440420",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "But..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224405",
      "subQuestName": "Offer a Sango Pearl to the seven royal tombs",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722440501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722440501": {
            "id": "722440501",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Traveler... Have you... found the bridle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440502"
            ]
          },
          "722440502": {
            "id": "722440502",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Could you... let me have a look at it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224406",
      "subQuestName": "Offer a Sango Pearl to the seven royal tombs",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722440601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722440601": {
            "id": "722440601",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Ahhh... This is the Divine Bridle. The genuine article indeed!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440602"
            ]
          },
          "722440602": {
            "id": "722440602",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "I never thought that the day would come when I might lay eyes on it once more. Traveler, tell me — whence did you get this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440603"
            ]
          },
          "722440603": {
            "id": "722440603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "From Aberaku...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440604"
            ]
          },
          "722440604": {
            "id": "722440604",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "From Aberaku no Mikoto himself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440605"
            ]
          },
          "722440605": {
            "id": "722440605",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "How strange. I remember clearly that he was a great figure from the days when our nation had just been founded.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440606"
            ]
          },
          "722440606": {
            "id": "722440606",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "But it was said that he planned to usurp the seat of the Sunchild, and was branded with the crime of treason.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440607"
            ]
          },
          "722440607": {
            "id": "722440607",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "But since you say that you obtained it from his hands, perhaps there are hidden things at work that I do not understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440608"
            ]
          },
          "722440608": {
            "id": "722440608",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "So, fate has decreed the bridle should resurface here... Ah, I can recall the faces of those children already...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440609"
            ]
          },
          "722440609": {
            "id": "722440609",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "This way, I might finally atone for my failings...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440610"
            ]
          },
          "722440610": {
            "id": "722440610",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Traveler, place the bridle within the pool at the Locus. With it, we can surely revivify their souls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722440611"
            ]
          },
          "722440611": {
            "id": "722440611",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Yes, that they may be made whole, and that they may walk the path to the next life hale!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
