    {
      "subId": "7224411",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Soul Guide's Locus",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722441101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722441101": {
            "id": "722441101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "One, two, three... Looks like we've finished paying respects at all seven tombs!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441102"
            ]
          },
          "722441102": {
            "id": "722441102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go back to the stone shrine and tell the spirit there about this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224412",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722441201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722441201": {
            "id": "722441201",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Ah, Piramumon. You did so love books, saying that there must be a world outside our knowledge, though I did not believe you then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441202"
            ]
          },
          "722441202": {
            "id": "722441202",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "I always smiled and shook my head at your wild pronouncements. Alas, alas! I should have believed you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441203"
            ]
          },
          "722441203": {
            "id": "722441203",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "You said that one day you would escape the Dainichi Mikoshi and venture into paths beyond...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441204"
            ]
          },
          "722441204": {
            "id": "722441204",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Go now, Piramumon. Let no one shackle you again. Go, be free!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441205"
            ]
          },
          "722441205": {
            "id": "722441205",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "And you, Orupeusu, Orupeusu. What would I give to hear you sing again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441206"
            ]
          },
          "722441206": {
            "id": "722441206",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "There was no one who could hear your clear, pure voice, and did not wish to sing along in their hearts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441207"
            ]
          },
          "722441207": {
            "id": "722441207",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "The night before the Rite of Solar Return, you suddenly wished to hear my voice. No matter what, you desired to hear me sing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441208"
            ]
          },
          "722441208": {
            "id": "722441208",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "You told me that no matter how terribly I sang, you would not laugh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441209"
            ]
          },
          "722441209": {
            "id": "722441209",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "You knew, didn't you? You knew that this Solar Return would be your last.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441210"
            ]
          },
          "722441210": {
            "id": "722441210",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "And yet I... To the end, I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441211"
            ]
          },
          "722441211": {
            "id": "722441211",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Clymene?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441212"
            ]
          },
          "722441212": {
            "id": "722441212",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "...I apologize, Traveler. That was unsightly of me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441213"
            ]
          },
          "722441213": {
            "id": "722441213",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "The female official who serves the Sunchildren is meant to maintain her purity... She shall never marry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441214"
            ]
          },
          "722441214": {
            "id": "722441214",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Thus, I had no children of my own all my life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441215"
            ]
          },
          "722441215": {
            "id": "722441215",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "These children, whom I served and watched grow older... At some point, they became closer to me than blood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441216"
            ]
          },
          "722441216": {
            "id": "722441216",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler. Thank you for finding the bridle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441217"
            ]
          },
          "722441217": {
            "id": "722441217",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "It has passed through the hands of every Sunchild, and the memories it has inherited are enough to fill the gaps in their souls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441218"
            ]
          },
          "722441218": {
            "id": "722441218",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "...Even though these memories are double-sided.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441221"
            ]
          },
          "722441221": {
            "id": "722441221",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Of course. In this case, the memories are two-fold. On one hand, you have your own memories, and on the other, you have others' memories of you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441222"
            ]
          },
          "722441222": {
            "id": "722441222",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Thus the gaps are being filled by both the Sunchildren's own memories, imprinted upon the bridle...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441223"
            ]
          },
          "722441223": {
            "id": "722441223",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "As well as the memories of them as the children who were blamed by Byakuyakoku, of those who became children of sin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441224"
            ]
          },
          "722441224": {
            "id": "722441224",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "My own memories are insufficient, and so I had to supplement them with those of the people of our nation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441225"
            ]
          },
          "722441225": {
            "id": "722441225",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "And it is thanks to these transgressions that have been laid upon them that they have now been remembered by Byakuyakoku, and can now leave their afterimages behind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441226"
            ]
          },
          "722441226": {
            "id": "722441226",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler. My greatest wish now lies fulfilled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441227"
            ]
          },
          "722441227": {
            "id": "722441227",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "I can finally... be at ease.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722441228"
            ]
          },
          "722441228": {
            "id": "722441228",
            "speakerId": 20346,
            "speakerName": "Clymene",
            "text": "Yes, I... can finally be with those children again..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
